@SmartGlassesMiddleware_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Text Request Example
POST {{SmartGlassesMiddleware_HostAddress}}/api/text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "What's the weather like today?"
}

###

### Audio Request Example
POST {{SmartGlassesMiddleware_HostAddress}}/api/audio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "audioBase64": "UklGRiQAAABXQVZFZm10IBAAAAABAAEAQB8AAEAfAAABAAgAZGF0YQAAAAA=",
  "transcription": "What time is it?"
}

###

### Media Upload Example (image)
POST {{SmartGlassesMiddleware_HostAddress}}/api/media
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

What's in this image?
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### Get Recent History
GET {{SmartGlassesMiddleware_HostAddress}}/api/history?count=10

###

### Get History by ID
GET {{SmartGlassesMiddleware_HostAddress}}/api/history/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

